{"title": "Shelf", "pageid": 38641, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Shelf", "categories": ["Containers", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Interactitem_Cupboard_Faded.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a6/Interactitem_Cupboard_Faded.webp/300px-Interactitem_Cupboard_Faded.webp, /w/images/a/a6/Interactitem_Cupboard_Faded.webp 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Shelf image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a6/Interactitem_Cupboard_Faded.webp/300px-Interactitem_Cupboard_Faded.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a6/Interactitem_Cupboard_Faded.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Shelves</b> are a a static clutter container that cannot be picked up or moved. Usually contains <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous</a> items such as <a href=\"/wiki/Cup\" title=\"Cup\">Cup</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Knife\" title=\"Knife\">Knife</a>.\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Containers\" title=\"Containers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png/25px-Containers_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png/38px-Containers_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Containers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png/25px-Containers_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" c